fty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, the domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne n\\pi ,\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-162634/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "553f7b9d-c387-59b0-a0d6-9624d012e414"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-162634"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-162633/selection/44893c23f05e66e5e019ed914d57bc67e9de850732be0186aa8515e150e19846" :answer/id #uuid "ddf970b3-806e-5a31-b1ce-ff0f1167f532" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "n\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162633/selection/f9e7a14f8df16ddc0b8c9c300a1c8f6b0892a5eb7fef52ade9da5adc24b66b68" :answer/id #uuid "b08bba42-f115-528b-aeee-31ae6a1147f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162633/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "d78972e1-364f-5c9c-b75d-a5c126773be4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162633/selection/12d00d8cbbf4a04c75ab1402693219a77b5a75fe9d62eb748da8bc882b535ddd" :answer/id #uuid "91d23e93-de31-5d38-b630-2f024f82b2c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162633/selection/5731c44f8a0ba38d16e5ac63030182f401b185f28788c966c2e45bed740fe438" :answer/id #uuid "62f977ea-112e-535d-819b-fa65c0382ae2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2n\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162633/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b3c36841-9fd3-542a-a7d9-046dc1155f19" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-162633/selection/44893c23f05e66e5e019ed914d57bc67e9de850732be0186aa8515e150e19846" :answer-field/choices ["q-162633/selection/44893c23f05e66e5e019ed914d57bc67e9de